  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilience Rises: Supporting Female Entrepreneurs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women Marketplace aims to empower female entrepreneurs and artisans, with a specific focus on local entrepreneurs, foster resilience, and contribute to their economic recovery. During the event, the participants can showcase their skills, products and services, make connections and establish partnerships with other entrepreneurs and potential customers, gain knowledge about entrepreneurship and foster a sense of resilience among women impacted by conflict. After the event, the female entrepreneurs will have continuous access to training and networks via low-tech digital channels.</narrative>
  </description>
